# Immersturm Predator: "Whenever this creature becomes tapped, exile up to one target card from a graveyard and put a +1/+1 counter
# on this creature." Bot1 casts it on turn 1 (a Black Lotus and a Mountain, so the Lotus is in Bot1's graveyard). Bot2 casts a
# Brainstorm on turn 2. On turn 3 the Predator attacks, which taps it: the trigger exiles Bot2's Brainstorm (not Bot1's Lotus) and
# the counter makes it 4/4 before damage, so Bot2 takes 4. Bot1's graveyard is untouched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Immersturm Predator
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Brainstorm
Island x13

